WHAT IS AND IS NOT IN THIS REPOSITORY

Anything a browser can fetch from the deployed site is downloadable by anyone
who opens it. That is a property of static hosting and no licence changes it.
The material judged too costly or too sensitive to hand out that way is
therefore not here at all -- it is kept locally and listed in .gitignore, and
the application is written to degrade deliberately when it is absent rather
than to pretend it is present.

THIRD-PARTY AND UNPUBLISHED WORK

Some references in this project derive from work that is not the copyright
holder's to license, including unpublished student research. Those values do
not ship with the public build. Do not reintroduce them into a public
deployment without the permission of the person whose work they are.

Vendored dependencies under assets/vendor/ carry their own licences and are
governed by them, not by this file.

THE USUAL DISCLAIMER, WHICH HERE IS NOT BOILERPLATE

This software is provided "as is", without warranty of any kind. It estimates
biomechanical quantities from a phone camera. It is not a medical device, it
diagnoses nothing, and the copyright holder accepts no liability for any
decision taken on the basis of a number it produced.
